<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" class="em_padding2" style="padding: 35px 25px 50px;"> 
<table align="center" width="100%" border="0" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"> 
<tbody> 
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" class="em_defaultlink" style="font-family: 'Maitree', 'Times New Roman', Times, serif; font-size: 28px; line-height: 32px; color: #223341;"> 
<div class="mktoText" id="text_3"></div></td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" height="20" style="height: 20px; font-size: 0px; line-height: 0px;">&nbsp;</td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" class="em_defaultlink" style="font-family: 'Chivo', 'Trebuchet MS', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; line-height: 28px; color: #223341;"> 
<div class="mktoText" id="text_4"> 
<div> 
<div style="color: #223341; font-family: Chivo, 'Trebuchet MS', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: -webkit-center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;">
 Join us for an informative webinar on&nbsp; 
<b>Thursday April 15, 1pm ET</b> 
<span style="font-size: 16px;"><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span>to learn more about&nbsp; 
<strong>Flywire's new 1098-T offering</strong> 
<span>&nbsp;</span>that enables institutions to provide 1098-T forms to students and authorized users directly from within the Flywire solution. 
</div> 
<div class="“p1”" style="color: #223341; font-family: Chivo, 'Trebuchet MS', Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 17px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: -webkit-center; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;"> 
<br /> 
<div>
 During this webinar, we'll share how easy it is for institutions to deliver 1098-T forms to students and authorized users electronically, or via our printing and mailing services, a demonstration&nbsp;of our 1098-T offering and integration options with Banner and PeopleSoft. 
</div> 
<div class="“p1”"> 
<br /> 
<div>
 Speakers: 
</div> 
<div> 
<strong>David King</strong> 
<span>&nbsp;</span>- CTO, Flywire 
</div> 
<div> 
<strong>Corey Rethage</strong> 
<span>&nbsp;</span>- Director, Product Management, Flywire&nbsp; 
</div> 
</div> 
</div> 
<br /> 
<p><a href="https://more.flywire.com/webinar-simplify-your-1098-T-process.html" target="_blank"><img src="http://more.flywire.com/rs/372-QSQ-649/images/Register_Button.png" alt="" width="150" height="56" constrain="true" imagepreview="false" border="" /></a></p> 
<div class="“p1”"> 
<br /> If you can't make the live webinar, please register, and we will share the recording after the broadcast. 
</div> 
</div> 
</div></td> 
